WEBVTT

1
00:00:13.459 --> 00:00:16.380
Mandy stood by the front door with their parents.

2
00:00:17.640 --> 00:00:20.721
Mom was taking them shopping for new school clothes.

3
00:00:20.741 --> 00:00:23.602
"What will you do, honey?"

4
00:00:24.142 --> 00:00:25.403
Mom asked Dad.

5
00:00:25.423 --> 00:00:28.444
"Don't worry about me."

6
00:00:28.984 --> 00:00:29.684
He smiled.

7
00:00:31.216 --> 00:00:32.757
"I'll be working on my den."

8
00:00:34.398 --> 00:00:36.480
Vinnie and Mandy looked at each other.

9
00:00:36.500 --> 00:00:40.002
"Do you have to do it now, Dad?"

10
00:00:41.283 --> 00:00:42.023
Mandy asked.

11
00:00:43.284 --> 00:00:45.206
She had left the album on a shelf.

12
00:00:46.486 --> 00:00:48.027
He would certainly see it.

13
00:00:48.047 --> 00:00:50.629
"Why shouldn't I?

14
00:00:51.790 --> 00:00:53.871
You'll be out," replied Dad.

15
00:00:55.132 --> 00:00:56.933
He opened the front door for them.

16
00:00:56.953 --> 00:01:00.516
"But whined Mandy.

17
00:01:01.880 --> 00:01:02.801
"What's the matter?"

18
00:01:03.462 --> 00:01:04.102
asked Mom.

19
00:01:05.263 --> 00:01:06.884
"You love to go shopping."

20
00:01:06.904 --> 00:01:11.388
"I know, but said Mandy.

21
00:01:11.408 --> 00:01:15.491
"We need a miracle," Vinnie whispered.

22
00:01:16.812 --> 00:01:17.753
"What did you say?"

23
00:01:18.674 --> 00:01:19.314
asked Mom.

24
00:01:21.556 --> 00:01:24.419
The phone suddenly rang, and Dad answered it.

25
00:01:24.439 --> 00:01:27.922
"It's your mother," he said to Mom.

26
00:01:27.942 --> 00:01:30.644
"I'll just be a minute, kids.

27
00:01:32.040 --> 00:01:34.002
Wait in the car," Mom said.

28
00:01:34.022 --> 00:01:40.326
"Well, okay," said Mandy, feeling a bit uncertain.

29
00:01:41.727 --> 00:01:47.551
Vinnie winked at Mandy and said, "Uh, I left something upstairs.

30
00:01:48.992 --> 00:01:49.832
I'll be right back."

31
00:01:49.852 --> 00:01:52.154
"Me too!"

32
00:01:52.754 --> 00:01:53.975
Mandy added quickly.

33
00:01:55.256 --> 00:01:56.757
They both ran upstairs.

34
00:01:56.777 --> 00:02:03.329
"I think those kids are hiding something," Dad muttered to himself.

35
00:02:04.649 --> 00:02:09.111
When they got to the attic, the children let out a long sigh.

36
00:02:09.131 --> 00:02:17.094
"I was so scared he'd find this," Mandy said as she took the album from the shelf.

37
00:02:17.114 --> 00:02:21.156
"We don't have a lot of time," Vinnie said.

38
00:02:21.176 --> 00:02:24.217
"Do you want to go on a trip now?"

39
00:02:25.438 --> 00:02:26.238
Mandy nodded.

40
00:02:26.258 --> 00:02:28.079
"But hurry!

41
00:02:29.279 --> 00:02:30.960
Mom won't be on the phone long."

42
00:02:32.172 --> 00:02:33.573
Vinnie opened the album.

43
00:02:34.994 --> 00:02:39.736
The old man was standing by a table with a small black machine on it.

44
00:02:41.217 --> 00:02:44.219
A woman was holding something and it was glowing.

45
00:02:47.981 --> 00:02:51.063
looks like a sewing machine," remarked Mandy.

46
00:02:51.083 --> 00:02:53.764
"But what's glowing?"

47
00:02:55.305 --> 00:02:56.746
Vinnie looked at the photo.

48
00:02:56.766 --> 00:03:00.328
"Some kind of curtain, I think."

49
00:03:01.776 --> 00:03:07.719
Before he could look more closely, the children fell down the dark tunnel.

50
00:03:10.061 --> 00:03:14.863
Mandy landed on soft grass, and Vinnie fell beside her.

51
00:03:16.084 --> 00:03:17.905
A crowd was gathered nearby.

52
00:03:17.925 --> 00:03:19.866
"Where are we?"

53
00:03:20.606 --> 00:03:22.948
Mandy asked, dusting off her clothes.

54
00:03:24.469 --> 00:03:26.890
She wore a pretty pink dress with ribbons.

55
00:03:28.651 --> 00:03:30.292
Vinnie looked down at his pants.

56
00:03:31.816 --> 00:03:33.497
They came just to his knees.

57
00:03:34.638 --> 00:03:36.840
He wore long socks and black shoes.

58
00:03:38.321 --> 00:03:43.725
"I don't know," Vinnie began, but he was interrupted by music.

59
00:03:45.786 --> 00:03:47.828
The children ran to join the crowd.

60
00:03:49.189 --> 00:03:53.652
Everyone was standing in front of a very large, carved marble arch.

61
00:03:54.933 --> 00:03:58.476
Behind the arch was a huge building with many columns.

62
00:03:59.692 --> 00:04:03.936
"The flag on that arch looks familiar," said Mandy.

63
00:04:03.956 --> 00:04:08.261
"Mandy!" Vinnie cried excitedly.

64
00:04:08.281 --> 00:04:15.348
"I think we're in—" Before Vinnie could finish, someone grabbed Mandy.

65
00:04:15.368 --> 00:04:17.830
"There you are!"

66
00:04:18.611 --> 00:04:19.892
a young woman shouted.

67
00:04:19.912 --> 00:04:23.396
"I've been looking everywhere for you!"
